WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.527
With large models advancing, SAM has spread across
computer vision,

00:00:04.607 --> 00:00:07.002
but using it underwater falls short.

00:00:07.082 --> 00:00:10.784
Its features do not adapt to murky, low-contrast water,

00:00:10.864 --> 00:00:16.423
and it needs manual foreground prompts that defeat
automatic salient segmentation.

00:00:16.503 --> 00:00:22.749
The authors argue that unlocking SAM here requires
two things at once: a large-scale dataset

00:00:22.829 --> 00:00:24.811
capturing underwater saliency,

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:29.831
and an architecture that teaches SAM to see
underwater and prompt itself.

00:00:29.911 --> 00:00:31.550
This paper delivers both.
